# Renvor site (V7 landing page) — repository ignore rules
#
# This repository is PRIVATE. The V7 landing source was committed on 2026-08-12; the
# "currently empty, nothing committed" note that stood here is obsolete.
#
# T095–T098 (release honesty, installation commands, CTA destinations, and the
# website-code licence and brand-asset terms) are COMPLETE as of 2026-08-12.
#
# The site is still NOT deployed and nothing is published. Deployment is blocked by
# gates outside this repository: T101, T102, T106, T108, and T111.
#
# Scope: keep dependencies, build output, caches, local state, and credentials out of Git.
# A file being ignored is not the same as a file being safe to create — see the credentials
# section, which is a backstop and not a licence to keep secrets in the working tree.

# --- Dependencies ---
# pnpm is the package manager (packageManager: pnpm@11.21.0). pnpm-lock.yaml is COMMITTED
# on purpose: this is a deployable application, not a reusable library, so the exact
# resolved tree is part of what gets reviewed and shipped.
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Next.js build output and caches ---
# `out/` is the static export produced by `pnpm run build`; `.next/` is the build cache.
# Committing either would mean reviewing minified output and would let the built site drift
# from the source that supposedly produced it.
out/
.next/

# The Content-Security-Policy and the server configuration are DERIVED from `out/` at build
# time (scripts/generate-csp.mjs). They are deliberately not committed: one inline script is
# the RSC flight payload, whose hash changes with any component edit, so a checked-in policy
# would be stale after the next copy change — and a stale strict policy is what gets weakened
# to make a site work again. The image generates and carries its own.
sws.generated.toml

# --- Inspection and test captures ---
# Screenshots taken while checking themes, motion, and layout. They are evidence of a
# point-in-time check, not source, and they go stale silently. Six such files existed in
# the pre-migration directory and were deliberately not copied into this repository.
inspection/
*.screenshot.png
playwright-report/
test-results/
.playwright-mcp/

# SBOMs and scan reports are produced by CI from the image and the lockfile. They describe
# one build, so committing one would be committing a claim that goes stale silently.
sbom/

# --- Environment and credentials (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials
credentials.*
secrets/
*.secret

# --- Editor and IDE state ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Local agent and development-tool state ---
.claude/
.claude-flow/
.specify/
.remember/

# --- Operating-system artifacts ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs and temporary files ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
tmp/
*.tmp

# --- TypeScript incremental build info ---
*.tsbuildinfo
